>What's the status of using another alphabet instead Latin's (ie tengwar)? Is it possible something like this will be official?
>I've read some of the proposals, and I found them interesting, so I'd like to know if it's worth to start learning any of them (given the fact I'm learning lojban too)

*takes a whack at the horse*

No, none of them will be official as far as anybody in concerned. There are a million proposals, one I've done, three Lakmeer has done, and probably a few thousand more aside. I think the idea is that 80% of the planet can read Roman letters, which makes it 80% accessible to the entire planet, and 80% easier to learn.

That being said, we're not going to stop you from using any of them for your own pleasure.



      


